    ok 1 - one invocation over the three bundles writes 3 issuers across 3 distinct sectors
      ---
      duration_ms: 50.490313
      type: 'test'
      ...
    # Subtest: the written dataset independently reloads and measures 3 of 13 sectors
    ok 2 - the written dataset independently reloads and measures 3 of 13 sectors
      ---
      duration_ms: 21.611406
      type: 'test'
      ...
    # Subtest: each sector measures exactly as it does when its own bundle is ingested alone
    ok 3 - each sector measures exactly as it does when its own bundle is ingested alone
      ---
      duration_ms: 38.728981
      type: 'test'
      ...
    # Subtest: the combined identity is reproducible and independent of the order the bundles were supplied in
    ok 4 - the combined identity is reproducible and independent of the order the bundles were supplied in
      ---
      duration_ms: 33.067577
      type: 'test'
      ...
    # Subtest: provenance is not identity: ingesting copies from different directories gives the same datasetVersion
    ok 5 - provenance is not identity: ingesting copies from different directories gives the same datasetVersion
      ---
      duration_ms: 33.148584
      type: 'test'
      ...
    1..5
